WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.200
From a fresh Linux host. Your private cloud. One guided install.

00:03.200 --> 00:07.500
Run one command: curl the TailHome installer and pipe it to bash.

00:07.500 --> 00:13.800
Onboarding names the server, connects Tailscale, and selects service profiles.

00:13.800 --> 00:18.500
The installer checks the host, sets up Docker and Tailscale, and starts the stack.

00:18.500 --> 00:24.000
The private dashboard opens with running services on your tailnet.
